ights inquiries may contact the Equal Opportunity Office at (906) 635-2213. Quick Links About LSSU Academics Admissions Athletics Campus Life Campus Map Traditions Copyright © 2022 All Rights Reserved by LSSU . Equal Opportunity | Diversity | Accessibility | Clery Act | Consumer Information | Campus Safety Information Candidate Details"
